{"step_index":498,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:22:16Z","thinking":"Identified two distinct enterprise entries. One associated with 최유창 at 제이알이엔티 and the other linked to 이석창 at 서림문화사. Noted a key difference in the second entry: the representative is different from 이석창.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const path = require('path');\nconst ExcelJS = require(path.resolve('./node_modules/exceljs'));\n\nasync function inspect() {\n    const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n    await workbook.xlsx.readFile('data/(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx');\n    const ws = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n    \n    // Print row 1 headers\n    console.log('Header Row 1:', ws.getRow(1).values);\n    console.log('Header Row 2:', ws.getRow(2).values);\n\n    // Let's search for any row where industry (만화) or representative or company has 이수연, 이지현, 이진수, 최유창, 곽재홍\n    const names = ['이수연', '이지현', '이진수', '최유창', '곽재홍', '우수경', '이석창'];\n    ws.eachRow((row, rNum) => {\n        const valStr = JSON.stringify(row.values);\n        for (const n of names) {\n            if (valStr.includes(n)) {\n                console.log(`Row ${rNum}: ${valStr}`);\n            }\n        }\n    });\n}\n\ninspect();\n","Description":"Inspect matching rows in DB 취합 Excel file","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\904005bd-26f7-42af-8e1e-d808656915b0\\scratch\\search_rows.js","toolAction":"Creating file","toolSummary":"Create script to inspect rows in excel"}}]}
